# MySeattleSearch

> Puget Sound Real Estate & Hyperlocal Municipal Intelligence Platform operated by Joe Sheldon (Redfin), covering 58 neighborhoods across King and Snohomish Counties, Washington.

Last Updated: {{ buildDateISO }}
Canonical Root: https://myseattlesearch.com/
Sitemap: https://myseattlesearch.com/sitemap.xml

## Core Hubs
- [Home](https://myseattlesearch.com/): Directory of all 58 King & Snohomish County neighborhoods
- [Real Estate Services](https://myseattlesearch.com/realestate/): Market guidance, MoveDNA quiz, calculators, and curated searches
- [Regional Transit & Commute](https://myseattlesearch.com/region/transit-commute/): Puget Sound transit, ferries, airports, and highway telemetry
- [Regional Emergency & Safety](https://myseattlesearch.com/region/emergency-safety/): Active school closures, NWS severe weather, power outages, earthquakes, and wildfires
- [Social Notebook](https://myseattlesearch.com/cms/notebook/): Local market commentary and updates

